      "new": "1. Requires out/manifests/software-migration-4dma-research-e2-v2.json and both\n   out/manifests/fpga-<profile>.json with status == passed.\n2. Requires the software manifest to match the saved software lock\n   out/two-bit-20261003/software-sources.lock.json and the software platform\n   commit 481bd47fd9d62de212ed7eb4619a0554c05bc12e.  Requires the FPGA\n   manifests to match the current sources.lock.json and the hardware platform\n   commit 10fd189ee705c2b14983c513c295e381fc997e2d.  Verifies that the two\n   locks are identical except for the cva6 commit (old\n   6f968ec980e663046b89383b00d3dc85ce3e176f vs new\n   a0497a8dac660f8feb19d0f486d4862777276ed3)."
