  "checks": [
    "Software manifest must have status == passed, platform_commit == 481bd47fd9d62de212ed7eb4619a0554c05bc12e, and sources_lock_sha256 == b9519530a4f5df872c82a4c994c496cd9667736c47668bfc26d9e09ffc0d6f0d.",
    "Saved software lock out/two-bit-20261003/software-sources.lock.json must exist and its actual bytes must hash to b9519530a4f5df872c82a4c994c496cd9667736c47668bfc26d9e09ffc0d6f0d.",
    "FPGA manifests for roles 1 and 2 must have status == passed, platform_commit == 10fd189ee705c2b14983c513c295e381fc997e2d, and sources_lock_sha256 equal to the current sources.lock.json sha256.",
    "The two lock files must have identical top-level fields and identical component lists except cva6.commit, which must be exactly 6f968ec980e663046b89383b00d3dc85ce3e176f in the software lock and a0497a8dac660f8feb19d0f486d4862777276ed3 in the hardware lock.",
    "All non-cva6 lock components and all non-commit cva6 fields (path, upstream, legacy_head) must be byte-for-byte/field-for-field identical between the software and hardware locks.",
    "Software manifest artifacts must equal the original pinned set and hashes: out/rootfs.cpio, out/linux/arch/riscv/boot/Image, out/linux/platform.dtb, and out/opensbi/platform/fpga/ariane/firmware/fw_payload.bin.",
    "Every artifact listed by each manifest must exist and match its recorded sha256.",
    "Fixed inputs must be present and non-empty: both role .bit files, both .mcs files, OpenSBI payload, board CLI out/bench/idma_research, and kernel.release == 6.5.0-rc2-00093-gc0f5e13ea81f.",
    "Delivery/provenance must contain both lock files and all three manifests; DELIVERY.json and acceptance.json must report separate software_platform_commit/hardware_platform_commit and separate software_sources_lock/hardware_sources_lock hashes.",
